  "text": "Gallery | Hotel Deepa Comforts\nWe have identified a fraudulent activity where an individual has unauthorizedly added their mobile number to our google maps listing and is accepting payments for room bookings under false pretenses. To ensure your safety, please book rooms only through our official channels. For reservations, please call us at\n0824-2497101.\nHome\nAbout\nAmenities\nServices\nGallery\nContact Us\nGallery\nStep into a world of luxury and comfort at Hotel Deepa Comforts Mangalore. Explore our image gallery and discover the haven that awaits you. From our stylish rooms and elegant dining venues to our state-of-the-art fitness center and tranquil spa, we offer a haven for relaxation and rejuvenation.\nContact Details\nLuxury Business Hotel, M.G. ROAD,\nMangalore - 575 003, Karnataka, India.\ninfo@hoteldeepacomforts.com\n0824 411 7101 / 02 / 03\n0824 249 7101 / 02 / 03\nBooking\nCelebration\nConference\nLeisure\nContact Us\n©Deepa comforts, 2024. All Rights Reserved.",
